    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this beautiful three bedroom townhouse situated in the popular Castle Heights development in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis house is superbly presented and maintained by its current owners and the property has many features included such as a modern fitted kitchen with granite worktop and integrated appliances, underfloor heating on the ground floor, built-in wardrobes, fully tiled bathroom, LVT flooring to name just a few. Outside, it has a lovely enclosed rear garden with patio area that offers good privacy and to the front, has ample parking.\r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located within walking distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and is just short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and Ringaskiddy. It also has easy access to a regular public bus service close-by to the entrance of the park. \r\n\r\nViewing of this lovely starter home in a much sought after residential development in Carrigaline comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.02m x 1.86m \r\nLVT flooring, teak hardwood front door with side glazed panel, carpet stairway, centre light.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.55m x 1.53m \r\nLVT flooring, WC, WHB, extensive fitted storage unit, centre light. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.07m x 4.12m \r\nLVT flooring fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven/grill, hob, dishwasher, tile splashback, window blind, curtain pole, curtains, extensive fitted storage units, French doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.66m x 1.4m \r\nLVT flooring, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, fitted units. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.13m x 5.0m \r\nLVT flooring, extensive modern built-in storage units, gas fireplace with wooden surround, recessed lighting, TV point. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, stira stairs leading to overhead attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 2.6m \r\nCarpet floor, built-in wardrobe and dresser unit, window blind. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.39m x 0.8m \r\nTile floor, power shower unit with tile surround and enclosure, WC, WHB, centre light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.84m x 2.78m \r\nWooden floor, built-in overhead storage units, window blind, built-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.21m x 2.37m \r\nCarpet floor, built-in shelving unit, curtain pole, curtains, centre light, fitted shelf. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.16m x 1.77m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, chrome heated towel rail, window blind, bath unit with enclosure, WC, WHB. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
